    "detailed_description": "<u>*Currently, this game requires a minimum resolution of 1920*1080, and you can't save progress, which will be fixed in future updates.</u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481270/extras/13c58650aa222c6353c3812abbe6167a.avif?t=1692874836\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles in a strange world</h2>Lost in a mysterious space, you can't remember your purpose. Use your brain to find a way out.<br>It's a game about room escape with few textual clue. You have to figure out the usage of each item/facility on your own, and solve all the puzzles based on your understanding.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique puzzle system</h2>Solve the puzzles in a way you never experienced before.<br>Enjoy the original puzzle system, art style and music, all solo created by Yiico.",
    "about_the_game": "<u>*Currently, this game requires a minimum resolution of 1920*1080, and you can't save progress, which will be fixed in future updates.</u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481270/extras/13c58650aa222c6353c3812abbe6167a.avif?t=1692874836\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles in a strange world</h2>Lost in a mysterious space, you can't remember your purpose. Use your brain to find a way out.<br>It's a game about room escape with few textual clue. You have to figure out the usage of each item/facility on your own, and solve all the puzzles based on your understanding.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique puzzle system</h2>Solve the puzzles in a way you never experienced before.<br>Enjoy the original puzzle system, art style and music, all solo created by Yiico.",
